<title>USA: Seaway Food Q4 shr rises to $1.10.</title>
<headline>Seaway Food Q4 shr rises to $1.10.</headline>
<dateline>MAUMEE, Ohio 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months	  Three months</p>
<p>					   8/31/96	     8/26/95</p>
<p>Sales			     $154,513,000	$139,143,000</p>
<p>Net Income			   2,426,000	   1,248,000</p>
<p>   Per share			     $1.10		 $0.57</p>
<p>Average shares		     2,198,996	   2,193,508</p>
<p>				     Full yr ended    Full yr ended</p>
<p>					   8/31/96	     8/26/95</p>
<p>Sales			     $597,462,000	$559,244,000</p>
<p>Net Income			   5,505,000	   4,480,000</p>
<p>    Per share			    $2.50		 $2.04</p>
<p>Average shares		     2,197,661	   2,196,643</p>
<p>Full company name is Seaway Food Town Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The fourth quarter 1996 contained 14 weeks while the fourth quarter 1995 contained 13 weeks. Seaway estimated the extra week added about $642,000 or $0.29 per share to net income in the fourth quarter 1996.</p>
</text>
